OL,3,ARussian strikes wound nine and damage
OL,4,AUkraine's power network ahead of talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FOvernight drone and ballistic missile
OL,7,Fattacks damaged Ukrainian energy
OL,8,Finfrastructure, President Volodymyr
OL,9,FZelenskyhas said, causing blackouts and
OL,10,Fdisrupting water supplies.
OL,12,FZelensky said 12 Ukrainian regions came
OL,13,Funder attack with the capital Kyiv hit
OL,14,Fhardest.
OL,16,FNine people are reported to have been
OL,17,Fhurt across the country, including one
OL,18,Fchild, in the wave of attacks that
OL,19,Fconsisted of more than 30 ballistic
OL,20,Fmissiles and over 170 drones.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
